# mobile (Flutter) — {% .ProjectName%}

AI agent instructions for the Flutter mobile app.

## Stack

- Dart 3.5+, Flutter 3.24+
- go_router (navigation), provider (state)
- flutter_lints (linting)

## Navigation Rules (Constitution X)

- Bottom navigation shows 3-5 destinations from
  `metadata.mobile.destinations` — no hardcoded tabs.
- The left drawer opens ONLY via the app-menu
  IconButton; the right drawer opens ONLY via the
  profile CircleAvatar.
- Drawers are never open simultaneously and are closed
  on startup.
- Tab switches preserve per-tab state
  (StatefulShellRoute.indexedStack).
- Android back closes an open drawer before leaving.
- On screens wider than 600dp, permanent navigation
  surfaces replace the drawers (Amendment 1.0.1).

## Rules

- Dart is fully type-annotated; `flutter analyze`
  must pass with zero issues.
- Use `lib/navigation/` for all navigation state; do
  not add navigation logic to pages.
- All changes require tests (`flutter test`).

## Commands

```bash
flutter pub get        # install dependencies
flutter analyze        # static analysis
flutter test           # run tests (including navigation rules)
flutter build apk      # build Android APK
```
